{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is clear: find and defeat your mysterious opponent before you run out of cards. If your deck empties, you haven't just lost the game; you've lost yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MANAGE YOUR DECK: Tap, discard and draw cards to deal with events and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AUTOMATED COMBAT: with strategy based on using the cards and equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EACH RUN IS UNIQUE: new enemies, new challenges\u2026 or a new death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EQUIPMENT MANAGEMENT:\u00a0Collect, upgrade, and customize your gear to gain the edge in battle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Autobattler system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a tactical autobattler where every fight is shaped by unit positioning and weapon range. Smart placement can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/1837008ab1015863895fc01ad539273a.poster.avif?t=1759859016\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/1837008ab1015863895fc01ad539273a.webm?t=1759859016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/1837008ab1015863895fc01ad539273a.mp4?t=1759859016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel a cursed world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a map filled with unpredictable encounters and dangerous enemies waiting to challenge you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/5302494dc35bb5216e4b1758437fbdb2.poster.avif?t=1759859016\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/5302494dc35bb5216e4b1758437fbdb2.webm?t=1759859016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/5302494dc35bb5216e4b1758437fbdb2.mp4?t=1759859016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spend Your Soul, Seize Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exhaust your cards (pieces of your soul) to unlock powerful actions: Recharge weapons, interact with wandering people, open glowing chests and empower your hero with buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/8aeae3cf90b1f99ae8cc24338624db70.poster.avif?t=1759859016\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/8aeae3cf90b1f99ae8cc24338624db70.webm?t=1759859016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/extras/8aeae3cf90b1f99ae8cc24338624db70.mp4?t=1759859016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who was the stranger? Why did they curse you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921690?t=1759859016","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921690?t=1759859016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/dd75637d5aefba3c8430c1c03a1b32ee78a05670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759859016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921690/d